Source of truth:
    data/regulations/udcpr_canonical_manifest.json
    data/regulations/udcpr_source_chunks.json

Rebuilds:
    public.rules
    public.knowledge_cards

Does NOT modify:
    public.regulations
    public.tables

IMPORTANT:
    The existing database schemas are used exactly as they exist.

Actual rules schema:
    id
    regulation_id
    category
    name
    description
    condition_json
    result_json
    priority
    enabled
    metadata

Actual knowledge_cards schema:
    id
    regulation_id
